# Sarawak AI News Publisher

For a scheduled or controller-dispatched content publication run:

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/automation.md`,
  `automation/candidate.schema.json`, and
  `automation/prompts/publisher.md` first.
- Treat the supplied candidate manifest as the complete discovery handoff.
- Independently verify every original source page.
- Require an English headline and substantive English article body.
- Require a meaningful Sarawak link and a named AI or digital technical
  function.
- Modify and stage only `README.md`, `data/items.json`, and `data/site.json`.
- Run all tests, audits, build, browser checks, and Git checks in the contract.
- Publish nothing when no story qualifies or any check is incomplete.
- Verify the remote Git hash before reporting success.
